    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code> with the given <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/DefaultListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code></a>\nand <code>ServletContext</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/DefaultListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code></a>和<code>ServletContext</code>的<code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code> with the given <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/DefaultListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/support/DefaultListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code></a>的<code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Register request/session scopes, environment beans, a <a href=\"ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "注册请求/会话范围、环境 Bean、<a href=\"ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a> 等。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>servletContext</code> - the <code>ServletContext</code> to run in",
      "translation": "<code>servletContext</code> - 要运行的 <code>ServletContext</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the <code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code> instance to use for this context",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 用于此上下文的 <code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code> 实例",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If you wish to register annotated <em>component classes</em> with a\n<code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>, you can use an\n<a href=\"../../../context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>, as demonstrated in the following example.\nComponent classes include in particular\n<a href=\"../../../context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>\nclasses but also plain <a href=\"../../../stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>\nclasses as well as JSR-330 compliant classes using <code>jakarta.inject</code> annotations.",
      "translation": "如果您希望将注释的<em>组件类</em>注册到<code>GenericWebApplicationContext</code>中，可以使用<a href=\"../../../context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>，如下例所示。组件类主要包括<a href=\"../../../context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>类，但也包括普通的<a href=\"../../../stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>类以及使用<code>jakarta.inject</code>注解的符合 JSR-330 规范的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implements <a href=\"../ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>, but is not intended for\ndeclarative setup in <code>web.xml</code>. Instead, it is designed for programmatic setup,\nfor example for building nested contexts or for use within\n<a href=\"../../WebApplicationInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>WebApplicationInitializers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现了 <a href=\"../ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>，但不打算在 <code>web.xml</code> 中进行声明式配置。相反，它专为程序化配置而设计，例如用于构建嵌套上下文或在 <a href=\"../../WebApplicationInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>WebApplicationInitializers</code></a> 中使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If you intend to implement a <code>WebApplicationContext</code> that reads bean definitions\nfrom configuration files, consider deriving from <a href=\"AbstractRefreshableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>AbstractRefreshableWebApplicationContext</code></a>,\nreading the bean definitions in an implementation of the <code>loadBeanDefinitions</code>\nmethod.",
      "translation": "如果您打算实现一个从配置文件读取 Bean 定义的`WebApplicationContext`，请考虑继承<a href=\"AbstractRefreshableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>AbstractRefreshableWebApplicationContext</code></a>，并在`loadBeanDefinitions`方法的实现中读取这些 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Interprets resource paths as servlet context resources, i.e. as paths beneath\nthe web application root. Absolute paths — for example, for files outside\nthe web app root — can be accessed via <code>file:</code> URLs, as implemented\nby <code>AbstractApplicationContext</code>.",
      "translation": "将资源路径解释为 Servlet 上下文资源，即 Web 应用程序根目录下的路径。绝对路径（例如，用于访问 Web 应用程序根目录之外的文件）可以通过 `<code>file:</code>` URL 进行访问，这是由 `<code>AbstractApplicationContext</code>` 实现的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Replace any stub property sources with actual instances.",
      "translation": "将任何存根属性源替换为实际实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If not set, the implementation is supposed to use a default for the\ngiven namespace or the root web application context, as appropriate.",
      "translation": "如果未设置，实现应使用给定命名空间的默认值或根 Web 应用程序上下文（视情况而定）。",
      "count": 2
    },
